        "coverage": {"exhaustive": true, "fullyRepresented": false, "entries": [
          {"sourceIndex": 0, "sourceRef": "#/paths/~1x/get", "scope": "target", "status": "represented", "operationKey": "readHeaders", "bindingSelector": "#/paths/~1x/get", "requirements": []},
          {"sourceIndex": 0, "sourceRef": "#/paths/~1x/get/responses/204/headers/X-Ids", "scope": "projection", "status": "excluded", "reasonCode": "openapi20.response_header_excluded", "rule": "OAPI20-P-03", "requirements": []}
        ]}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "OAPI20-SS-11",
      "description": "A request-body Schema Object whose `allOf` branches intersect emptily is a WELL-FORMED upstream declaration that admits no instance, and the JSON-lane position it governs is accounted `represented` with `fullyRepresented: true`. The governing dialect's validity condition for `allOf` is structural only — a non-empty array whose elements are valid schemas — and neither that dialect nor any accepted OAS edition gives satisfiability any role, so nothing about `allOf: [{type: string}, {type: object}]` is upstream-invalid; Core OBI-D-17 says the same from the other side, requiring no proof of satisfiability for a schema to be well-formed. §12.2 admits `invalid` only where the declaration is upstream-invalid, and §3.2 keeps `invalid` and `excluded` apart on exactly that line, so this position is neither: the emitted OBI carries the declaration as written, nothing is projected away, and coverage stays fully represented. The `application/json` lane is selected by media type rather than by the resolved declaration, which is why no admission test gates this position; the intersecting sibling is the control that keeps the scenario about the empty intersection rather than about `allOf`. Where the resolved declaration DOES select carriage — the character-data and raw-octet lanes, a multipart part, a urlencoded property — §9.1's stated no-admissible-candidate rule excludes the alternative instead, which is a different rule with a different status and is not asserted here.",
      "source": {
        "bindingSpec": "openbindings.openapi-2.0@1",
        "content": {
          "swagger": "2.0",
          "info": {
            "title": "Disjoint allOf",
            "version": "1"
          },
          "schemes": [
            "https"
          ],
          "host": "api.example",
          "basePath": "/v1",
          "paths": {
            "/disjoint": {
              "post": {
                "operationId": "disjointBody",
                "parameters": [
                  {
                    "name": "payload",
                    "in": "body",
                    "required": true,
                    "schema": {
                      "allOf": [
                        {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "object"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "responses": {
                  "204": {
                    "description": "stored"
                  }
                },
                "consumes": [
                  "application/json"
                ]
              }
            },
            "/intersecting": {
              "post": {
                "operationId": "intersectingBody",
                "parameters": [
                  {
                    "name": "payload",
                    "in": "body",
                    "required": true,
                    "schema": {
                      "allOf": [
                        {
                          "type": "object"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "name": {
                              "type": "string"
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "responses": {
                  "204": {
                    "description": "stored"
                  }
                },
                "consumes": [
                  "application/json"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "outcome": "synthesized",
        "operations": [
          "disjointBody",
          "intersectingBody"
        ],
        "bindings": [
          {
            "operationKey": "disjointBody",
            "bindingSelector": "#/paths/~1disjoint/post"
          },
          {
            "operationKey": "intersectingBody",
            "bindingSelector": "#/paths/~1intersecting/post"
          }
        ],
        "coverage": {
          "exhaustive": true,
          "fullyRepresented": true,
          "entries": [
            {
              "sourceIndex": 0,
              "sourceRef": "#/paths/~1disjoint/post",
              "scope": "target",
              "status": "represented",
              "operationKey": "disjointBody",
              "bindingSelector": "#/paths/~1disjoint/post",
              "requirements": []
            },
            {
              "sourceIndex": 0,
              "sourceRef": "#/paths/~1disjoint/post/consumes/0",
              "scope": "alternative",
              "status": "represented",
              "operationKey": "disjointBody",
              "bindingSelector": "#/paths/~1disjoint/post",
              "requirements": []
            },
            {
              "sourceIndex": 0,
              "sourceRef": "#/paths/~1intersecting/post",
              "scope": "target",
              "status": "represented",
              "operationKey": "intersectingBody",
              "bindingSelector": "#/paths/~1intersecting/post",
              "requirements": []
            },
            {
              "sourceIndex": 0,
              "sourceRef": "#/paths/~1intersecting/post/consumes/0",
              "scope": "alternative",
              "status": "represented",
              "operationKey": "intersectingBody",
              "bindingSelector": "#/paths/~1intersecting/post",
              "requirements": []
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "OAPI20-SS-12",
      "description": "A root-level consumes declaration is inherited by every body operation that declares none of its own, and the inherited alternative is a distinct interaction unit at each operation: its omission would remove that operation's invocation path, so the coverage ledger carries one represented alternative entry per operation, each pointing at the same source unit #/consumes/0 (the source-local identifier is the declaration, not a per-operation pointer). The sole concrete consumes alternative self-selects at both operations without a requestMedia requirement. Both SDKs previously failed the whole coverage call on this document as a duplicate coverage entry, keying the alternative on its source unit alone (OAPI20-S-01, OAPI20-P-03).",
      "source": {
        "bindingSpec": "openbindings.openapi-2.0@1",
        "content": {
          "swagger": "2.0",
          "info": {
            "title": "Inherited consumes",
            "version": "1"
          },
          "host": "api.example",
          "schemes": [
            "https"
          ],
          "consumes": [
            "application/json"
          ],
          "paths": {
            "/a": {
              "post": {
                "operationId": "createA",
                "parameters": [
                  {
                    "name": "payload",
                    "in": "body",
                    "schema": {
                      "type": "object"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "responses": {
                  "200": {
                    "description": "ok"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "/b": {
              "post": {
                "operationId": "createB",
                "parameters": [
                  {
                    "name": "payload",
                    "in": "body",
                    "schema": {
                      "type": "object"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "responses": {
                  "200": {
                    "description": "ok"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "outcome": "synthesized",
        "operations": [
          "createA",
          "createB"
        ],
        "bindings": [
          {
            "operationKey": "createA",
            "bindingSelector": "#/paths/~1a/post"
          },
          {
            "operationKey": "createB",
            "bindingSelector": "#/paths/~1b/post"
          }
        ],
        "coverage": {
          "exhaustive": true,
          "fullyRepresented": true,
          "entries": [
            {
              "sourceIndex": 0,
              "sourceRef": "#/paths/~1a/post",
              "scope": "target",
              "status": "represented",
              "operationKey": "createA",
              "bindingSelector": "#/paths/~1a/post",
              "requirements": []
            },
            {
